n_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"A Studied Seduction\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTMwNTEwLnBuZw==/original/MnG4FG.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">A Studied Seduction</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_game_7426186\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://ebihime.itch.io/studied-seduction/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$6.99 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTMwNzgzLnBuZw==/original/gzt234.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Arthur Ruthven&#x27;s thirty-fifth birthday is fast approaching, but he&#x27;s worried that his life has started to stagnate.<br><br>Arthur was once a history teacher in Edinburgh, but an incident with a former pupil causes Arthur to retire early. Newly uneasy about teaching, and unsure if he can pursue the career he once loved, Arthur returns to live with his mother in their old family bookshop. He would prefer to forget his days as a teacher, and the anxieties that came with them...<br><br>But Arthur can only keep his past at bay for so long, and his life takes an unexpected turn when his mother hires a new helper at the bookshop over the summer holidays: one Mason Tierney, one of Arthur&#x27;s former students.<br><br>Mason has done some growing up in the five years since Arthur last saw him, and now, he&#x27;s twenty-one. Mason tries to be friendly with Arthur, but Arthur wonders. Is Mason being<em> too</em> friendly - and will Mason&#x27;s interest in Arthur stir up uncomfortable memories Arthur would far rather see buried for good?<br><br><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTMwODA1LnBuZw==/original/tl4JID.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>- 65,000 words of text (approx 2-3 hours of reading)<br>- A linear story with no choices or branches<br>- A slowburn BL romance story set in Scotland<br>- Two cute main characters<br>- A custom soundtrack<br>- Gay angst!<br><br><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5NTMwODA5LnBuZw==/original/poo5Sg.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>Story/programming: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/ebihimes\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">ebi-hime</a><br>Character art: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/dearstrayghost.bsky.social\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Bo</a><br>Background art: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/Luciam_AS\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Luciam Art Studio</a><br>GUI: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/elduator\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Elduator</a><br>Music: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://lentilcorelli.com/\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lentil<br></a>Opening video: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/signormao_art\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Signor Mao</a><br>Extra transitions: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://kia.itch.io/image-dissolve-transitions\">Kia<br></a>Kinetic text tags: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wattson.itch.io/\">Wattson</a><br>Proofreading: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zelan.itch.io/\">Zelan</a><br>Made for <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://itch.io/jam/yaoi-game-jam-2026\">YaoiJam 2026<br><br>(</a>Also submitted to the <a href=\"https://itch.io/jam/the-queer-wrongs-jam-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Queer Wrongs Jam</a> for the somewhat scandalous nature of the relationship and Arthur&#x27;s neuroses about it&nbsp;\uD83D\uDCA6)</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg role=\"img\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_6864080\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"01 October 2026 @ 15:21 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 5 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-android\">Android</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div tabindex=\"0